--   ★★ v.2  (thou shalt be called by a new name, which the mouth of Yahuah (LORD) shall name)
--        NT:     ★★ Revelation 2:17 (a white stone, and in the stone a new name written, which no
--                man knoweth saving he that receiveth it), ★★ Revelation 3:12 (I will write upon
--                him my new name) — THREAD 1 (the new name given to the overcomer)
--        Extras: none warranted (named in prose)
--        Tanakh: ★ Isaiah 62:4 (thou shalt be called Hephzi-bah) — the new name itself; bound in THREAD 2
--   v.3  (a crown of glory in the hand of Yahuah (LORD), and a royal diadem)
--        NT:     none warranted distinct (the crown imagery woven into THREAD 1/THREAD 3 prose)
--        Extras: none warranted
