--                shall be said... Ye are the sons of the living Elohim (God)), ★★ Hosea 2:23 (I
--                will say to them which were not my people, Thou art my people), ★ Hosea 2:19 (I
--                will betroth thee unto me for ever) — THREAD 2 (the two-house reversal)
