--        NT:     ★ Revelation 19:7 (the marriage of the Lamb is come, and his wife hath made
--                herself ready), ★ Revelation 21:2 (the holy city, new Jerusalem... prepared as a
--                bride adorned for her husband) — THREAD 3 (the bridegroom and the bride)
--        Extras: none warranted
--        Tanakh: Hosea betrothal woven (cross-linked to THREAD 2)
--   ★ v.6-7 (I have set watchmen upon thy walls... give him no rest, till he establish... Jerusalem
--           a praise in the earth)
--        NT:     none warranted distinct (the ceaseless intercession woven into THREAD 4 prose;
--                no single NT verse forced)
--        Extras: none warranted
--        Tanakh: THREAD 4 anchors on the watchmen (canon-internal, the restoration-crown frame)
